==Romanian==

===Etymology===
From {{der|ro|sla}} ''chramŭ'' ({{der|ro|cu|храмъ}}), from {{der|ro|sla-pro|*xormъ}}. Compare Russian, Macedonian, and Serbo-Croatian {{m|sh|храм}}.

===Noun===
{{ro-noun|n|hramuri}}

# [[church]] (service)
# parish fair, dedication day, celebration in honor of a patron saint of a church
# the [[patron]] of a church

====See also====
* {{l|ro|biserică}}

